"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-02-11T16:05:30Z","assignee":{"login":"bmatican","id":395011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTAxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican","html_url":"https://github.com/bmatican","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/777632444","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/7211#issuecomment-777632444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/7211","id":777632444,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3NzYzMjQ0NA==","user":{"login":"acube123","id":6658556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTg1NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6658556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123","html_url":"https://github.com/acube123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-11T16:46:17Z","updated_at":"2021-02-11T16:46:17Z","body":"The main change would be\r\n```\r\n@@ -550,9 +553,13 @@ Status MultiStageAlterTable::LaunchNextTableInfoVersionIfNecessary(\r\n     VLOG(3) << \"Start backfilling for \" << yb::ToString(index_info_to_update);\r\n     TRACE(\"Starting backfill process\");\r\n     VLOG(1) << \"Starting backfill process\";\r\n-    WARN_NOT_OK(\r\n-        StartBackfillingData(catalog_manager, indexed_table.get(), index_info_to_update),\r\n-        \"Could not launch Backfill\");\r\n+    auto s = StartBackfillingData(catalog_manager, indexed_table.get(), index_info_to_update);\r\n+    if (!s.ok()) {\r\n+      WARN_NOT_OK(s, \"Could not launch Backfill\");\r\n+      // Let us mark the schema change as done. i.e. remove fully_applied_*\r\n+      // We will leave it in ALTERING state, until backfill is completed.\r\n+      ClearAlteringState(catalog_manager, indexed_table, current_version, /* change_state to RUNNING */ false);\r\n+    }\r\n     return Status::OK();\r\n   }\r\n   ```\r\nEssentially, when the 2nd index goes through a bunch of changes to get into the “DO_BACKFILL” state, the next step is to launch the backfill\r\nif we already have a backfill-in progress, we get a NOT-OK status, and so we do not launch the backfill ….. however, we do not go through and mark the “alter to DO_BACKFILL” state as complted (by calling ClearAlteringState)\r\nthis causes the clients to continue to receive the “old” version of the table …. even though all the tablets have now moved to the “newer” version\r\nD8946 also would have fixed this issue --- by allowing the TServer/Client to accept off-by-one schema versions, is possible\r\nBut, the simpler, real fix is what I posted above — to just clear the altering state, even though we are unable to launch the 2nd backfill because one is already in progress.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/777632444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"acube123","id":6658556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTg1NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6658556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123","html_url":"https://github.com/acube123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acube123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4368771696,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQzNjg3NzE2OTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/4368771696","actor":{"login":"amitanandaiyer","id":32495790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDk1Nzkw","avatar_url":"https